# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "While many stochastic steps in the algorithm are controllable with a random seed, some features have randomness not controllable with a seed. Specifically, the following kwargs values for `add_pauli_checks` will cause undeterministic check picking: `cost=\"LER\"`, `method=\"genetic\"`, and `method=\"windowed_genetic\"`. For deterministic behavior use `add_pauli_checks(..., cost=\"gamma\", method=\"windowed\")`, which are the default values.\n"
msgstr "Bagaman maraming stochastic na hakbang sa algorithm ang makokontrol gamit ang random seed, may ilang feature na may randomness na hindi makokontrol ng seed. Partikular, ang mga sumusunod na kwarg value para sa `add_pauli_checks` ay magdudulot ng hindi deterministic na pagpili ng check: `cost=\"LER\"`, `method=\"genetic\"`, at `method=\"windowed_genetic\"`. Para sa deterministic na pag-uugali, gamitin ang `add_pauli_checks(..., cost=\"gamma\", method=\"windowed\")`, na siyang mga default na value.\n"

